<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57049" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήδ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cared for, beloved</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρεῖς τε κασιγνήτους, τούς μοι μία
					γείνατο μήτηρ, κηδείους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.294
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>careful of</i>, or <i>caring for</i>, c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφαὶ κ. τέκνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					487
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of a funeral</i> or <i>tomb, sepulchral</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					87
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				538
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. θρίξ</span>
			<i>offered on a tomb</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				226
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. οἴκτοισιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					147
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
